{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/PVP_Battles.png?t=1747719933\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Battle_Steam.gif?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Team_Building.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Buildyourteam.gif?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Evolutions.png?t=1747719933\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Evolution.gif?t=1747719933\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Collect_121_Faes.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Indexzoom.gif?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Hero_Classes.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/classes.gif?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Elemental_Types.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Elements_All_labeled.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to FaeTerra</strong>\u00a0- a vibrant, PvP-focused auto-battler where strategy meets charm. Build your  team from 121 adorable creatures, each with their own unique abilities and personalities. Master powerful synergies, outsmart your opponents in tactical battling, and rise through the ranks in competitive multiplayer battles. Whether you're a seasoned strategist or a creature collector at heart, FaeTerra offers endless replayability, with rich team-building and depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/GUI_Divider.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About FaeTerra:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle</strong> your friends in PVP, manage your team, evolve, and compete in battle!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Discover</strong> unique strategies and combos to create the most powerful team. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Custom builds</strong> allow you to craft their very own unique teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect</strong> and master  121 unique Fae's with 13  elemental types.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PVP ranked and Casual modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player leveling and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranked leaderboards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle pass with unique cosmetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player leveling and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Presskit:\u00a0</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Discord_Button.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Kickstarter_Button.png?t=1747719933\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3011470/extras/Magi.png?t=1747719933\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/0d4f76f7e12bfc7ec6c2b6bd9b14dfe4b543d051.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Novice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/9b497aa3f5307015518f91dca581a2a312caa128.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/0cc2e5fed9794c1e9db2c40324f2c5af8879e254.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Journeyman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/28d62a88a550552dcbb1f35172f1e687332835ed.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/5dc08a9244760556123c360fc3c1d27b35030925.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/93f746213d22e30ad2b76979b9941cbaa3e1f16d.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Silver","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/f7eef3137cb30565c8246a5d6e70c1f5f51866d3.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTerra Gold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3011470/ff015cae579a4cf344c4bd668788972df1bb9f53.jpg"},{"name":"FaeTer